{"id":"zachem","lemma":"зачем","pos":"adv","rank":124,"glosses":["why, what for (for what purpose, to what end, with what goal)"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/57/Ru-%D0%B7%D0%B0%D1%87%D0%B5%D0%BC.ogg/Ru-%D0%B7%D0%B0%D1%87%D0%B5%D0%BC.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Зачем ты им звонил?","en":"Why did you call them?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1270122","words":[null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"(to) them","l":"он"},{"g":"to call","l":"звонить"}]},{"text":"Зачем ты делаешь это?","en":"Why are you doing this?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/104532","words":[null,{"g":"you"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"делать"},{"g":"this / it is"}]},{"text":"Зачем вам эти вещи?","en":"Why do you need these things?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1270110","words":[null,{"g":"(to) you","l":"вы"},{"g":"this/that one","l":"этот"},{"g":"thing, object","l":"вещь"}]},{"text":"Я знаю, зачем я здесь.","en":"I know why I'm here.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},null,{"g":"I"},{"g":"here"}]},{"text":"Я знаю, зачем они это делают.","en":"I know why they do it.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to know: to be familiar…","l":"знать"},null,{"g":"they"},{"g":"this / it is"},{"g":"to make, to do","l":"делать"}]}]}